  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WFP- Multi-year support the enabling environment for humanitarian assistance in Northern Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to enhance prevention, coordination as well as fill critical gaps in the overall humanitarian response in Mozambique, focusing on the support that WFP provides to the wider humanitarian community through 1) Anticipatory action and Forecast-Based Financing; 2) Vulnerability-Based Targeting; 3) The Food Security and Livelihoods Cluster; and 4) Nutrition programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
